      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お前と戦わなければ、\r\n俺は美学を貫けないのだ。",
        "official_en": "I must face you in combat...or I have failed to live with honor.",
        "real_en": "If I don't fight you, I can't stay true to my principles."
      },
