      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "戦わずしての栄冠など\r\n屈辱以外の何物でもない。",
        "official_en": "There is no greater dishonor than to be crowned champion without a fight.",
        "real_en": "Being crowned champion without a fight would be nothing but humiliating."
      },
